\ A runtime definition shadowing a prelude compound; the diagnostic names the prelude.
\
\ A defining word body now gets a transient frame, so this definition runs at top level.
\ The trailing `0 drop` keeps the statement from ending in `;`: freeze collects it for
\ binary runtime, where the definition reaches the durable entry frame on every tier.
\ The real source location is shared by interpreted and AOT diagnostics.

use { taken: } "def_over_import_mod.1z" ;

taken .

nip: ( -- y ) [ 0 ] ; 0 drop
